  "summary": "Senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore from the Nick Xenophon Team will resign from the Australian Senate due to holding dual British citizenship by descent through her mother. She made this announcement after confirming advice from the UK Home Office and a specialist barrister. Kakoschke-Moore, previously unaware of her British citizenship, intends to have the issue referred to the high court to decide on filling the vacancy. The recount of the 2016 Senate election might bring NXT candidate Tim Storrer into the Senate. Despite her resignation, Kakoschke-Moore plans to continue her political career with NXT. Nick Xenophon expressed devastation over her departure but remains optimistic about her future in politics. He also stated that the process of filling the Senate seat is legally uncertain."
